The SCEPTRE bennu module now parses logic into statements (``logic.extra.statements``) by replaying how bennu's logic module finds tags and delays. Each statement has its target tag, expression, the tags it reads, its delay, and any problems bennu would have with it, including lines bennu ignores. Each tag's ``extra`` lists the logic lines that read and write it (``read_by_logic`` and ``written_by_logic``). Logic data models have a new ``extra`` field.
